    [18366]={name="Gordok's Handguards",quality=3,ilvl=60,reqLevel=56,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Unfinished Gordok Business'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Captain Kromcrush in Dire Maul. Objective: Find the Gauntlet of Gordok Might and return it to Captain Kromcrush in Dire Maul.According to Kromcrush, the \"old timey story\" says that Tortheldrin - a \"creepy\" elf who called himself a prince - stole it from one of the Gordok kings.",zone="Dire Maul",questName="Unfinished Gordok Business",lore="Now you da king, so maybe you get prized Gordok artifact back from creepy elf who calls himself Prince! Da king before you failed, just like all da other kings since Tortheldrin - da creepy elf - stole it from old timey Gordok king!",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 1.0%."},
